{"material_id": "ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2021a.q31.material.recovered", "text": "材料：初中开学的第一天，七年级（1）班班主任李老师到班级开班会，她在点名的过程中看到了一个比较熟悉的名字。“上官文俐？”“到”。“你是不是有个姐姐叫上官文伶？“是的。”“我记得上官文伶，她是我前几年带过的学生，她学习很努力，成绩优秀，平时很有礼貌，大家都很喜欢她，我看你和她长得非常像，在各个方面你也应该像她一样优秀。”两个月后，班主任推荐她参加学校的中学生创新竞赛，结果她取得了好成绩。得到这个好消息后，李老师对她说，“正如我想的那样，你不但爱学习，还很有创新意识。”在随后的日子里，上官文俐努力学习，团结同学，积极为班级服务，努力使自己成为李老师所期望的那样、像她姐姐一样优秀的学生。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "bc09ca86a431e7ae93900b873ada51aff025d97ce5142bb61d72afef462d89da", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2843, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3137, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "bc09ca86a431e7ae93900b873ada51aff025d97ce5142bb61d72afef462d89da"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2021a.q31"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.m4.k02", "ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.m8.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.ability.care", "ntce.zhongxue.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.302.r024", "ntce.outline.302.r046", "ntce.outline.302.r047"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2021a.q31"], "word_count": 294, "level": "zhongxue", "subject": "jiaoyuzhishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "bc09ca86a431e7ae93900b873ada51aff025d97ce5142bb61d72afef462d89da", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2843, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3137, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with